From 975ec29c8303e451857b0126ce5fb1bf64e0fe45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 05:34:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] publish done-tail parking reports to their chats

Why: a worker reported "Everything else is done" only in a scheduled
reason. Scheduled events are silent and still hold the chat open, so the
origin heard nothing until the user asked whether the redesign was done.

Use the authorized progress-notice fallback rather than hard refusal:
real reasons often say "only remaining" about required CI, review and
deployment. Refusing those or automatically watching/completing them
would misclassify unfinished acceptance. Append a comment and a distinct
park_progress_notice atomically with successful schedule/time-block.
The existing cursor-driven TUI/gateway notifiers deliver it. Keep state,
watch semantics, producer routing, and chat-closeout unchanged. Explicit
and inherited watches and validated card producers do not get the notice.

Proof:
- Original MacBook event171760 retrieved independently; hub shadow copy
  preserved as JSON fixture. Both tool paths exercised through real
  subscription claiming and TUI/gateway formatting, with only historical
  remote probe execution stubbed pending. Removing each publication call
  fails the regression. Rollback and stale-run tests prevent orphan notes.
- 26 focused tests green; 11 behavioral mutants killed.
- 78 consumer files: 1401 passed, one missing wake locale key (fixed in all
  17 catalogs), one skip. Wake-fold/i18n focused rerun green.
- Real replay over 23 read-only hub DBs: original claimed21 not reproducible.
  Corpus22 broad includes two 'phone watch' false matches;20 strict.
  New notices16/20:2 existing watches+2 capability-owner card waits exempt.
  Scope77/1224 shipped/merged records (source reason capped1200 chars,
  lower-bound recall). Every changed reason reviewed; informational only.
  Corpus sha256 4c9d442c18acb27ed7f7ee22f612956c370bc7a41ade0a7773333f3a5461c3e9.

Owner: t_410926d484cf82c3; evidence export t_ab4bd1a2f369acaf.
